{
  "name": "Booking.com, Expedia & TripAdvisor Hotel Rate Parity & Guest Review Monitor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Booking.com, Expedia & TripAdvisor Hotel Rate Parity & Guest Review Monitor\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nTrack daily room tariffs, OTA rate parity discrepancies, and guest review scores across Booking.com and TripAdvisor.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/booking-com-hotel-rates-reviews-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/booking-com-hotel-rates-reviews-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Booking.com Hotel Rates & Reviews Scraper** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "2b06af51-f8db-425b-abc6-c1cda169c40c",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Booking.com Hotel Rates & Reviews Scraper** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "1b1e9838-5be5-4717-a5be-78f7b0bc489e",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "24e4a8e6-2a35-40d0-a3eb-586807bef110",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 24
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "4319d971-afe6-4832-ab6f-beaa2c004637",
      "name": "Daily Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        200,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "20266a98-fad1-4ba3-a0a7-51c70ce6650b",
              "name": "queries",
              "value": "[\"boutique hotels Miami Beach rates\",\"New York Times Square hotel occupancy\"]",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "1e956c2f-e37d-43d2-ad30-8ea62e75e24b",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "f58907db-13b2-497a-a422-345810130232",
              "name": "pipelineCategory",
              "value": "Local & Maps",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "882589f3-4e4e-4031-a912-dc3f4302baed",
      "name": "Configure Target Queries",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        440,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/laborious_rumor~booking-com-hotel-rates-reviews-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ queries: $json.queries, maxItems: $json.maxItems }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        }
      },
      "id": "09a6a24c-554f-4107-aa52-fb0e9e9b8697",
      "name": "Run Apify Booking.com Hotel Rates & Reviews Scraper",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        700,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "e20efb83-c134-490f-a2c6-8d7432d2f998",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.verifiedStatus ?? true }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "929a1186-ed77-41ad-aab6-830dda6d6b78",
      "name": "Filter Verified Records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        980,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "compare": "selectedFields",
        "fieldsToCompare": "url, title, recordId",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a6986779-dce2-414b-aea9-71257f5c062b",
      "name": "Deduplicate Extracted Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1220,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const items = $input.all();\nreturn items.map((item, index) => {\n  const d = item.json || {};\n  const hasEmail = Boolean(d.email || d.workEmailPattern || (Array.isArray(d.emails) && d.emails.length > 0));\n  const hasUrl = Boolean(d.url || d.website || d.sourceUrl);\n  const qualityScore = (hasEmail ? 50 : 20) + (hasUrl ? 30 : 10) + (d.verifiedStatus ? 20 : 10);\n  return {\n    json: {\n      ...d,\n      normalizedTitle: d.title || d.fullName || d.businessName || d.name || 'Extracted Record #' + (index + 1),\n      primaryUrl: d.url || d.website || d.sourceUrl || '',\n      primaryContact: d.email || d.workEmailPattern || (Array.isArray(d.emails) ? d.emails[0] : '') || d.phone || '',\n      leadQualityScore: qualityScore,\n      priorityTier: qualityScore >= 80 ? 'HIGH_PRIORITY' : 'STANDARD',\n      actorSource: 'booking-com-hotel-rates-reviews-scraper',\n      processedAt: new Date().toISOString()\n    }\n  };\n});"
      },
      "id": "37af7b47-4298-4860-a7d7-c439b2b69f3f",
      "name": "Normalize and Score Records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1460,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "4af15c1c-1bca-46bb-ac88-c103f575f9f6",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.leadQualityScore }}",
              "rightValue": 60,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gte"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2ab5fecb-f4be-4981-a62d-2c947d28c8de",
      "name": "Route High-Quality Records",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1700,
        460
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "95dc80e5-dc15-445c-a11a-42dacc07c0dc",
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $json.normalizedTitle }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "b705d162-c62f-4de9-a980-db62e9356dad",
              "name": "url",
              "value": "={{ $json.primaryUrl }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "8cf0de42-80c0-4daf-aeb0-451b81a209af",
